  "question": {
    "text": "An electron in a hydrogen atom revolves around its nucleus with a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>76</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> in an orbit of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#197;</mi></math>. The magnetic field produced at the nucleus of the hydrogen atom is _______ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "40",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The magnetic field due to the electron is given by&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>q</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>The given data is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>76</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Thus, the magnetic field is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>76</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
